1
00:00:00,270 --> 00:00:03,630
A treasury agent puts thirty percent into a pool.

2
00:00:04,190 --> 00:00:05,450
The pool depegs.

3
00:00:05,450 --> 00:00:07,490
Eighteen thousand dollars, gone.

4
00:00:08,050 --> 00:00:11,190
Then the session ends, and the agent forgets it ever happened.

5
00:00:13,790 --> 00:00:15,930
Groundhog Vault is a treasury agent that remembers

6
00:00:15,930 --> 00:00:17,050
the cost of failure.

7
00:00:21,210 --> 00:00:22,530
It is a controlled experiment.

8
00:00:23,270 --> 00:00:24,830
Two agents get the same capital,

9
00:00:25,110 --> 00:00:26,990
the same decision logic, and the same market.

10
00:00:27,510 --> 00:00:28,930
Only one of them can read Sibyl memory.

11
00:00:30,770 --> 00:00:31,310
Life one.

12
00:00:32,530 --> 00:00:34,650
Both allocate thirty percent to MoonPool.

13
00:00:35,690 --> 00:00:37,990
Both lose eighteen thousand dollars.

14
00:00:37,990 --> 00:00:38,770
Identical by design.

15
00:00:41,930 --> 00:00:43,450
Then both runtimes are destroyed.

16
00:00:43,630 --> 00:00:44,940
The only survivor is Sibyl:

17
00:00:44,940 --> 00:00:48,010
an incident entity, an append-only event,

18
00:00:48,730 --> 00:00:50,970
and a risk policy keyed by the risk signature,

19
00:00:51,410 --> 00:00:52,450
not the protocol name.

20
00:00:54,070 --> 00:00:55,580
Life two.

21
00:00:55,580 --> 00:00:57,390
SunPool has a new name,

22
00:00:57,670 --> 00:00:58,570
but the same signature.

23
00:00:58,870 --> 00:01:01,910
A fresh Groundhog session recalls the policy and

24
00:01:01,910 --> 00:01:04,410
caps exposure at five percent.

25
00:01:04,410 --> 00:01:05,710
Amnesiac repeats thirty.

26
00:01:06,570 --> 00:01:09,050
Memory preserved twelve thousand three hundred dollars.

27
00:01:11,070 --> 00:01:14,250
The evidence view traces it end to end.

28
00:01:14,250 --> 00:01:18,270
The MoonPool incident, the policy it produced,

29
00:01:18,270 --> 00:01:21,950
and the fresh decision that policy changed.

30
00:01:22,430 --> 00:01:25,230
Every recommendation points back to the loss that taught it.

31
00:01:26,970 --> 00:01:27,750
That is the whole claim.

32
00:01:28,330 --> 00:01:29,430
Persist the loss.

33
00:01:29,690 --> 00:01:31,930
Recall it by signature in a fresh session.

34
00:01:33,090 --> 00:01:34,150
Change the decision.

35
00:01:36,570 --> 00:01:38,530
It works on a treasury's own history too.

36
00:01:38,870 --> 00:01:42,290
Record a real incident, then evaluate a differently

37
00:01:42,850 --> 00:01:45,810
named proposal in a brand new session.

38
00:01:46,050 --> 00:01:47,670
The recommendation is five percent,

39
00:01:47,670 --> 00:01:50,830
and it cites the policy and the incident behind it.

40
00:01:52,470 --> 00:01:55,550
The user signs that recommendation as a decision

41
00:01:55,550 --> 00:01:58,750
receipt on Base Sepolia, linking the allocation

42
00:01:58,750 --> 00:02:02,050
to hashes of its policy and source incident.

43
00:02:02,410 --> 00:02:03,670
The agent never holds the wallet.

44
00:02:05,970 --> 00:02:09,150
This is a simulation that never moves funds.

45
00:02:09,150 --> 00:02:11,730
A deployed guardian would issue constrained proposals:

46
00:02:11,730 --> 00:02:15,510
allowlisted assets, contract-enforced limits, evidence

47
00:02:15,510 --> 00:02:18,050
attached, and human approval before anything executes.

48
00:02:19,770 --> 00:02:20,830
Groundhog Vault.

49
00:02:20,830 --> 00:02:23,550
Do not pay for the same lesson twice.
